From 148fa2dccebd6829bfa44e8b1963b946940dde94 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 05:16:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Edit sheet on the player's desk, gear unlocked, dot for
 the Lightkeeper

Issue #64. The player's own sheet gets an Edit sheet button that opens
SheetEditor: name, pronouns, role and specialty, abilities, action
ratings and gilds, drive maximums, amounts and resistances, marks, up to
three scars and the profile, each box showing its maximum and a soft
warning for an ability outside the role or specialty. Save sends
edit_sheet with only the changed fields. The Change Gear dialog lets
every item come off and goes past the slots with a warning instead of a
stop. The Lightkeeper's business card carries a dot while
sheet_edited is set, and opening the sheet sends gm_sheet_seen.

Checked in Chromium (390x844, 820x1180, 1366x768) against a local
server: edits and gear saved and logged, dot shown live and cleared on
opening, no page errors; vite build passes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ETKqHLvkfH9k99JTnJzzKA
